  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Render the lardons in a pan over medium heat until crispy.",
    "Remove the lardons from the pan and set aside.",
    "Add the chopped onion to the pan and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic to the pan and cook for one minute.",
    "Add the ground anise seeds and chili powder to the pan and cook for one minute.",
    "Add the boudin noir to the pan and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Stir in the mashed sweet potato, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Pour the picarones batter into a ceramic tagine.",
    "Add the boudin noir mixture to the center of the picarones batter.",
    "Top with the rendered lardons and bake for 35 minutes."
  ],
